## Dev Server Quick Reference

```bash
# Start dev server
make run

# Access the deck
open http://localhost:3000/meets/[guest-slug]

# Keyboard shortcuts in presentation
→ / Space    Next slide
← / Backspace Previous slide
N            Toggle presenter notes
F            Toggle fullscreen
H / Home     Go to first slide
End          Go to last slide
```

---

## Summary

This rule enables iterative deck updates through:

1. **Understanding** - Confirm target deck and changes needed
2. **Iterating** - Make changes, you review via hot reload, provide feedback
3. **Completing** - Generate changelog documenting all updates

The dev server provides instant feedback - no build commands needed during iteration.
